{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2026-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1777593600, "end_date": 1778198399, "month_true_total": 103, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:26:26 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "224991597", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141303351", "personaname": "Lyceaos", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lyceaos/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 10475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10475, "last_played": 1709782779, "avatar": "c74689f1783d2a46cfabc6b28f29c2ac3126ee79"}, "language": "english", "review": "an aboslutely fantastic game. a bit grindy to max out things, but soooo worth it if you are an aliens fan. and this is very much made for fans of the aliens franchise and lore. every weapon has its canonic lore attached. it has an amazing co-op too. i can no recomend this enough", "timestamp_created": 1778189399, "timestamp_updated": 1778189399, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224972632", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024505787", "personaname": "SmokeyFantastico", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/smokeyfantastico/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 3131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 154, "playtime_at_review": 2479, "last_played": 1787367782, "avatar": "16653941e57869c8472255cd1d54bfe6492e4b33"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wish I hadnt ignored the game when it came out. Finally tried it on game pass and it was a blast. bought it on steam when it left game pass. so stoked for the sequel!", "timestamp_created": 1778171411, "timestamp_updated": 1778171411, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520444214344024658", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224932478", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163785669", "personaname": "The Black Tar Heroin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/srirachaking68/", "num_games_owned": 255, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 447, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 447, "last_played": 1778116485, "avatar": "216efaede2d54e60ab0f0ad88ebd28567eed3e61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pick up the game when it's on discount not worth the full price tag. There's no real gameplay loop and everything is predictable once you cruised through the campaign. Just finish the game with your friends and move on.", "timestamp_created": 1778117681, "timestamp_updated": 1778117681, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224924454", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052406100", "personaname": "BillTheBody", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052406100/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 176, "last_played": 1777245224, "avatar": "59305ce329204cff4d0370a0ce4f1bd025758cec"}, "language": "english", "review": "I somehow managed to play through the broken Colonial Marines game, but I really do think after less than 3 hours, I am hanging this game up.\r\n\r\nThe premise is great, straightforward, character building is always fun... but after playing solo and multiplayer, I honestly don't get the glowing reviews for this. There's a lot of 'go here, stand in one spot and just hold the trigger down. I can't quite put my finger on it, but all of the Xenos just look wrong... I feel like I am just blowing away waves of chimpanzees dressed in Alien costumes. They could have just given us a recycled version of AvP where every xeno doesn't have the same sliding motion after being shot.\r\n\r\nThe only light at this end of this tunnel is that I bought this on sale for $12, so I can file away the trauma of this ♥♥♥♥ game like a bad experience at Popeyes.", "timestamp_created": 1778106581, "timestamp_updated": 1778106581, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474424958229064941", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224922041", "author": {"steamid": "76561198311341106", "personaname": "Naglfar26", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198311341106/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1423, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1006, "last_played": 1782709627, "avatar": "b14b22c0479effac43ea353790c7877ac312c78c"}, "language": "english", "review": "just everything you would want in an aliens multiplayer shooter", "timestamp_created": 1778103558, "timestamp_updated": 1778103558, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}